 dunes"},{"surface":"தவிர்த்து","parts":[{"text":"தவிர்த்து","lemma":"தவிர்","gloss":"having stopped"}],"gloss":"having stopped"},{"surface":"நின்று","parts":[{"text":"நின்று","lemma":"நில்","gloss":"having stood"}],"gloss":"having stood"},{"surface":"அசைஇ","parts":[{"text":"அசைஇ","lemma":"அசை","gloss":"having rested"}],"gloss":"having rested"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தங்கினிர்","parts":[{"text":"தங்கினிர்","lemma":"தங்கு","gloss":"you stayed"}],"gloss":"you stayed"},{"surface":"ஆயின்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயின்","lemma":"ஆயின்","gloss":"if"}],"gloss":"if"},{"surface":"தவறோ","parts":[{"text":"தவறு","lemma":"தவறு","gloss":"fault"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"interrogative"}],"gloss":"is it a fault?"},{"surface":"தெய்ய","parts":[{"text":"தெய்ய","lemma":"தெய்ய","gloss":"expletive particle"}],"gloss":"indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தழைதாழ்","parts":[{"text":"தழை","lemma":"தழை","gloss":"foliage"},{"text":"தாழ்","lemma":"தாழ்","gloss":"hanging down"}],"gloss":"with hanging foliage"},{"surface":"அல்குல்","parts":[{"text":"அல்குல்","lemma":"அல்குல்","gloss":"waist"}],"gloss":"waist"},{"surface":"இவள்","parts":[{"text":"இவள்","lemma":"இவள்","gloss":"this woman"}],"gloss":"this woman"},{"surface":"புலம்பகல","parts":[{"text":"புலம்பு","lemma":"புலம்பு","gloss":"loneliness"},{"text":"அகல","lemma":"அகல","gloss":"to depart"}],"gloss":"so that her loneliness departs"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தாழை","parts":[{"text":"தாழை","lemma":"தாழை","gloss":"screw-pine"}],"gloss":"screw-pine"},{"surface":"தைஇய","parts":[{"text":"தைஇய","lemma":"தை","gloss":"adorned"}],"gloss":"adorned"},{"surface":"தயங்குதிரை","parts":[{"text":"தயங்கு","lemma":"தயங்கு","gloss":"swaying"},{"text":"திரை","lemma":"திரை","gloss":"wave"}],"gloss":"swaying waves"},{"surface":"கொடுங்கழி","parts":[{"text":"கொடுங்கழி","lemma":"கொடுங்கழி","gloss":"curved backwater"}],"gloss":"curved backwater","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இழுமென","parts":[{"text":"இழுமென","lemma":"இழுமென","gloss":"with a rushing sound"}],"gloss":"with a rushing sound","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஒலிக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"ஒலிக்கும்","lemma":"ஒலி","gloss":"sounding"}],"gloss":"sounding"},{"surface":"ஆங்கண்","parts":[{"text":"ஆங்கு","lemma":"ஆங்கு","gloss":"there"},{"text":"அண்","lemma":"அண்","gloss":"place"}],"gloss":"in that place"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெருநீர்","parts":[{"text":"பெரு","lemma":"பெரு","gloss":"great"},{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"vast ocean"},{"surface":"வேலி","parts":[{"text":"வேலி","lemma":"வேலி","gloss":"fence"}],"gloss":"fence"},{"surface":"எம்","parts":[{"text":"எம்","lemma":"யாம்","gloss":"our"}],"gloss":"our"},{"surface":"சிறுநல்லூரே","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"சிறு","gloss":"small"},{"text":"நல்","lemma":"நல்","gloss":"good"},{"text":"ஊரே","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"village"}],"gloss":"small, good village"}]}],"literal":"The tall chariot with a curved handhold, adorned with ornaments, coming gracefully, / having stopped and rested on the mountain-like vast sand dunes, / if you stayed, would it be a fault? / So that the loneliness of this woman, whose waist is adorned with hanging leaf-garments, departs, / in that place where the curved backwater with swaying waves is surrounded by screw-pines / and sounds with a rushing noise, / in our small, good village fenced by the vast ocean.","translation":"O Lord! If you stop your tall chariot, adorned with ornaments and fitted with a curved handhold, which comes gracefully, and rest on these mountain-like vast sand dunes, and stay with us, would it be a fault? It would dispel the loneliness of this girl who wears a low-hanging skirt of leaves, here in our small, beautiful village fenced by the vast ocean, where the curved backwater with swaying waves is surrounded by screw-pines and murmurs with a rushing sound.","modern":"ஆபரணங்களால் அலங்கரிக்கப்பட்டு, அழகாக வரும் வளைந்த கொடுஞ்சியைக் கொண்ட பெரிய தேரை, மலை போன்ற உயர்ந்த மணல் மேட்டில் நிறுத்தி, இளைப்பாறி, நீங்கள் தங்கிச் சென்றால் அது குற்றமாகுமா? தழையாடையை உடுத்திய இவளுடைய தனிமைத் துயர் நீங்குமாறு, தாழை மரங்கள் சூழ்ந்த, அசையும் அலைகளைக் கொண்ட வளைந்த உப்பங்கழி 'இழு' என்று ஒலியெழுப்பும் இடத்திலுள்ள, பெரிய கடலை வேலியாகக் கொண்ட எங்களது சிறிய நல்ல ஊரில் நீங்கள் தங்குவது தவறோ?","explanation":"The speaker is the heroine's friend (thōḻi), addressing the hero who has been visiting the heroine secretly by day. She gently suggests that he should stay in their village instead of returning home, hinting at a permanent union (marriage) rather than fleeting trysts. The poem is set in the Neytal (coastal) landscape, characterized by the vast ocean, sand dunes, screw-pines (tāḻai), and backwaters (kaḻi). The image of the chariot resting on the dunes reflects the desire for the hero to halt his journeys and settle down. The rushing sound of the backwater ('iḻumena') emphasizes the lively yet lonely atmosphere of the coastal village that awaits his presence.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.2],[1.2,1.6],[1.6,2.0],[2.0,3.3],[3.3,3.9],[3.9,4.84],[4.84,4.96],[4.96,5.46],[5.46,5.83],[5.83,6.2],[6.2,6.4],[6.4,7.13],[7.62,8.11],[8.11,8.72],[8.72,9.25],[9.25,9.51],[9.51,9.87],[9.87,10.23],[10.59,11.3],[11.3,11.74],[11.74,12.3],[12.3,12.8],[12.8,14.1],[14.1,14.6],[14.6,14.9],[15.07,15.4]],"female":[[0.46,0.8],[0.8,1.3],[1.3,1.8],[1.8,2.3],[2.3,3.6],[3.6,4.16],[4.16,4.94],[4.94,5.2],[5.2,5.69],[5.81,6.1],[6.1,6.4],[6.4,6.69],[6.69,7.08],[7.08,7.38],[7.57,8.07],[8.07,8.4],[8.4,8.57],[8.57,8.82],[8.82,9.4],[9.4,10.72],[10.72,11.78],[11.78,13.1],[13.1,13.6],[13.6,15.0],[15.0,15.5],[15.5,15.8],[15.97,16.3]]},"sync":[[["இழையணிந்து","having adorned with ornaments"]],[["இழையணிந்து","having adorned with ornaments"],["இயல்வரும்","coming gracefully"]],[["கொடுஞ்சி","curved handhold"]],[["நெடுந்தேர்","tall chariot"]],[["வரைமருள்","mountain-resembling"]],[["நெடுமணல்","vast sand dunes"]],[["தவிர்த்து","having stopped"],["நின்று","having stood"]],[["நின்று","having stood"],["அசைஇ","having rested"]],[["தங்கி